  "body": "If you're looking for a first home that gives you a bit more room to grow, this property is well worth considering.\r\nThe slightly more generous layout offers flexibility for young families or buyers planning ahead. The open-plan design makes daily living easy, while still allowing enough space for everyone to feel comfortable.\r\nNatural light, practical design, and a modern feel combine to create a home that's easy to enjoy from day one.\r\nUpstairs, the bedrooms are well-sized and positioned for privacy, with a master ensuite adding extra convenience.\r\n* Floor Area: approx. 160 sqm\r\n* Land Area: approx. 136 sqm\r\n* 4 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms\r\nA home that supports your next stage - not just your first step.",
